From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sean O'Hollaren <sean.ohollaren@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 23:38:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add FM-1 platform layer and browser build

src/fm1: video for a 240x240 RGB565 panel (320x200 squeezed to 240x150,
sent in strips), single-core semaphores, timer, input queue, heap, and
silent sound/OPL stubs. FM1=1 selects one core, no RP2040 interpolator,
a run-time short-pointer base, a platform-supplied WAD address, a title
screen that waits for a key, and no flash savegames.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
